    "stackRule": "Draw base, then the ambient layers, then the layers of milestones 1..n in order. Cloud layers rest where they are; water layers rest at opacity 0 (invisible). A milestone with hiddenFromMilestone may be hidden from that milestone on; the later layer already covers it. Positions are top-left in the 2048x1536 canvas; scale them for other sizes. anchor is the ground point to grow a part from; incidental parts are side effects (shadow or outline shifts) to show without animation. A layer with ambient.kind 'sway' is one tree; ambient.pivot is its trunk base, the point it sways around.",
